1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,837
When these bands squeeze tight, pay attention.

2
00:00:04,350 --> 00:00:10,745
Bollinger Bands are a twenty period moving average, with a band two standard deviations above and below it.

3
00:00:11,114 --> 00:00:13,234
They widen and narrow with volatility.

4
00:00:13,734 --> 00:00:16,477
When the market goes quiet, the bands squeeze together.

5
00:00:18,734 --> 00:00:21,029
A squeeze often comes before a bigger move.

6
00:00:21,377 --> 00:00:24,280
But it doesn't tell you which direction that move will go.

7
00:00:24,780 --> 00:00:28,035
And touching the upper band isn't a sell signal on its own.

8
00:00:28,443 --> 00:00:31,750
In a strong trend, price can ride the band for a long time.

9
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:35,585
Bollinger Bands are one of the Pro indicators on Meme Street.

10
00:00:35,924 --> 00:00:38,528
Practise reading them at memestreet.net.

